WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.770
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍尔。

2
00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.070
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

3
00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.370
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

4
00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:08.630
And we're best friends.
我们还是最好的朋友。

5
00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:12.430
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.
现在我们正为你们制作终极《办公室》重温播客。

6
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:16.790
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes
每周，我们都会剖析一集《办公室》，并分享独家幕后

7
00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.410
stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
故事，这些故事只有身临其境的我们才能告诉你们。

8
00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:20.570
We're The Office ladies.
我们是《办公室》女士。

9
00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:25.830
Welcome today.
欢迎来到今天的节目。

10
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.690
We are talking about the injury.
我们要聊的是《受伤》这一集。

11
00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:29.710
Good morning.
早上好。

12
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:30.910
And you know what?
你知道吗？

13
00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:32.010
Angela has an injury.
安吉拉受伤了。

14
00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:32.770
I do.
是的，我受伤了。

15
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:33.410
I do.
确实如此。

16
00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:34.310
Speaking of injuries.
说到受伤。

17
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:37.590
Guys, I was driving yesterday and I was chewing a piece of gum.
伙计们，我昨天开车的时候在嚼口香糖。

18
00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:38.670
I was popping my gum.
我当时在嚼着玩。

19
00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:42.310
And I bit the shiitake out of my tongue.
结果我狠狠地咬到了舌头。

20
00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:43.090
It's so bad.
太严重了。

21
00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:43.490
Look at it.
你看。

22
00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:44.350
No, it's really.
不，真的。

23
00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:44.850
Look at it.
你看一下。

24
00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:46.090
It's really bad.
真的很严重。

25
00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:47.630
It's a rave bump.
肿起了一个大包。

26
00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:50.910
And I keep bonking it when I talk.
我说话的时候总是不小心碰到它。

27
00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.770
So it's super intense.
所以感觉特别强烈。

28
00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:54.050
It's really painful.
真的很疼。

29
00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:59.310
So if during this podcast, all of a sudden I go, it's because I bonked it.
所以如果播客过程中我突然叫出声，那是因为我又碰到它了。

30
00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:00.050
Yeah.
是啊。

31
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:01.070
What's wrong with me?
我这是怎么了？

32
00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:02.630
I can't chew gum and drive.
我连嚼口香糖和开车都不能同时进行。

33
00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.930
I was like, I was on the phone with Josh.
当时我正和乔什通电话。

34
00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:06.090
And I was like, and another thing.
我正说着，还有一件事。

35
00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:07.850
Oh, my God.
天哪。

36
00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:08.810
It's really bad.
真的很严重。

37
00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:09.570
I know.
我知道。

38
00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:11.210
It really hurts.
真的很疼。

39
00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:11.750
Okay.
好吧。

40
00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:16.610
This episode was written by Mindy Kaling and directed by Brian Gordon.
这一集由敏迪·卡灵编剧，布莱恩·戈登执导。

41
00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:19.490
It is season two, episode 12.
这是第二季第12集。

42
00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:20.690
Wow.
哇。

43
00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:21.110
Yeah.
是啊。

44
00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:24.290
So we're on the second half of season two now.
我们现在已经进入第二季的后半段了。

45
00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.190
There were 22 episodes in season two.
第二季一共有22集。

46
00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:28.010
We've done 18 podcasts.
我们已经录了18期播客了。

47
00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:28.730
Yeah.
没错。

48
00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:30.650
When we hit 20, let's have a party.
等我们录到第20期时，开个派对吧。

49
00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:31.650
Okay.
好啊。

50
00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:32.630
Like, I don't know.
比如，我也不知道该怎么办。

51
00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:34.010
Like, I'll bring cupcakes or something.
比如，我会带纸杯蛋糕之类的过去。

52
00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:35.450
Why 20?
为什么是20？

53
00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:36.650
I don't know.
我不知道。

54
00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.870
I think we should have a party one week for casino night.
我觉得我们应该在某一周办个赌场之夜派对。

55
00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:41.810
End of season two.
第二季结束时。

56
00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:43.830
Let's have a party for number 23.
我们为第23集办个派对吧。

57
00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:45.750
Let's have a party every time.
我们每次都办派对吧。

58
00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:47.030
Random numbers.
随机数字。

59
00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.610
We don't need a reason to have a party.
我们办派对不需要理由。

60
00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:49.010
That's right.
说得对。

61
00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:50.690
Let me do a summary.
让我来做个总结。

62
00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:52.870
I can't even.
我简直无语了。

63
00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:57.030
I just start to look at my summary that I've written, and it makes me laugh.
我刚开始看我写的总结，就忍不住笑出声来。

64
00:01:57.230 --> 00:01:59.370
This is one of your very favorite episodes.
这是你最喜欢的剧集之一。

65
00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.570
People should know that.
大家应该知道这一点。

66
00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:07.530
You bought a shirt, Jenna, because of this episode, and you wore it all the time.
珍娜，因为这一集你买了一件衬衫，而且你经常穿。

67
00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.390
I bought it off Etsy.
我是从Etsy上买的。

68
00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:11.810
It was a foot and a grill.
上面画着一只脚和一个烤架。

69
00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:13.210
And a grilled foot.
还有一只烤熟的脚。

70
00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:16.770
It was like a comic book strip of a person grilling their foot.
就像连环画一样，画着一个人在烤自己的脚。

71
00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.270
I mean, okay, here it is.
我是说，好吧，就是这个。

72
00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:20.150
Here's the summary.
总结如下。

73
00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:22.450
I can't even say it.
我甚至说不出口。

74
00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:23.310
It's so funny to me.
我觉得太搞笑了。

75
00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:28.650
Michael accidentally steps on his George Foreman grill, injuring his foot.
迈克尔不小心踩到了他的乔治·福尔曼烤架，烫伤了脚。

76
00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:30.590
It's so funny.
太搞笑了。

77
00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:30.910
That's it.
就是这样。

78
00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:39.530
Dwight attempts to rescue Michael and crashes his car into a pool, causing what we will find out to be a concussion.
德怀特试图去救迈克尔，结果把车开进了池塘，导致他后来被发现得了脑震荡。

79
00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:48.390
During the workday, the staff does not dote on Michael as he had expected, and Dwight's concussion sparks an unexpected friendship with Pam.
工作期间，员工们并没有像迈克尔预期的那样对他嘘寒问暖，而德怀特的脑震荡让他和帕姆之间产生了一段意想不到的友谊。

80
00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:49.790
Aw.
噢。

81
00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:52.210
You guys must have had so much fun doing that.
你们拍那段戏一定很有趣。

82
00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:54.130
Oh, I loved it.
噢，我太喜欢了。

83
00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:59.030
I had so many scenes, just me and Rain, and we bonded so much.
我和雷恩有很多对手戏，我们建立了深厚的感情。

84
00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:04.910
Whenever you get put in a scene with someone, that means you're going to work with them for about three or four hours that day exclusively.
每当你和某人演对手戏时，意味着那天你要和他们单独相处三四个小时。

85
00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:12.430
And whenever they're, you know, having their conversations about how the scene is going or in the breaks, you get to just chitty chat.
每当他们讨论戏该怎么演，或者在休息的时候，你们就可以闲聊。

86
00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.710
You get to just hang out.
你们可以一起消磨时间。

87
00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.250
So I got to chitty chat a lot with Rain.
所以我有很多机会和雷恩闲聊。

88
00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:17.790
But I just love, also, I just love working with Rain.
而且我真的很喜欢和雷恩一起工作。

89
00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:19.150
I mean, you were so fortunate.
我是说，你太幸运了。

90
00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:20.690
You got to work with him all the time.
你一直都能和他一起工作。

91
00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:21.350
All the time.
一直都是。

92
00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:21.930
All right.
好吧。

93
00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:23.610
Should we get into the fast facts?
我们要开始讲快速事实了吗？

94
00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:24.570
All right.
好的。

95
00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:25.650
Fast fact number one.
快速事实第一条。

96
00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:28.810
This script was originally going to be called My Grilled Foot.
这个剧本最初打算叫《我的烤脚》。

97
00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:30.710
My Grilled Foot.
《我的烤脚》。

98
00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:31.990
But then they changed it.
但后来他们改了。

99
00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:39.550
So this is a standalone comedic episode that does not forward the Jim Pam storyline in any way.
所以这是一集独立的喜剧，并没有以任何方式推进吉姆和帕姆的故事线。

100
00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:44.210
Which was a little bit controversial because our last episode was Booze Cruise,
这引起了一些争议，因为我们上一集是《酒水游轮》。

101
00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:51.990
which was a huge bombshell confession by Jim to Michael that he is in love or that he has feelings for Pam.
吉姆向迈克尔坦白了他爱着帕姆，或者说对她有感觉，这可是个重磅炸弹。

102
00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:56.370
And so everyone tuned in to see what was going to happen.
所以大家都守在电视机前，想看看接下来会发生什么。

103
00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:57.470
And guess what?
你猜怎么着？

104
00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:00.390
We did not answer that question in any way.
我们根本没回答那个问题。

105
00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:01.370
In any way.
一点都没回答。

106
00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.710
So I'm sure, like, the fans were like, what the heck?
所以我敢肯定，粉丝们当时肯定在想，这到底是怎么回事？

107
00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:04.170
Yeah.
是啊。

108
00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.710
It does move forward Dwight and Angela a little bit.
它确实让德怀特和安吉拉的关系推进了一点点。

109
00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:07.190
It does.
确实。

110
00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:07.990
I have that down.
我记下来了。

111
00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:08.210
Yeah.
没错。

112
00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:13.370
It contains references to the Dwight-Angela love story, which was nice.
它包含了一些关于德怀特和安吉拉爱情故事的桥段，这很不错。

113
00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:15.410
It was.
确实不错。

114
00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:16.350
Which was nice.
真的很不错。

115
00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:20.690
I mean, we'll get to it, but there are some moments in here that I just love.
我是说，我们待会儿会讲到，但这里面确实有一些我非常喜欢的时刻。

116
00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.150
Yeah.
是啊。

117
00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:22.110
With Dwight and Angela.
关于德怀特和安吉拉的。

118
00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:22.610
I don't know.
我不知道。

119
00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:23.070
Me too.
我也是。

120
00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:27.370
This was also our highest rated episode so far.
这也是我们目前收视率最高的一集。

121
00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:28.050
What?
什么？

122
00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:28.630
Yeah.
是啊。

123
00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.970
I think a lot of people tuned in after Booze Cruise.
我想很多人是在看了《酒会游轮》那一集后才开始关注的。

124
00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:31.870
I think so.
我也这么觉得。

125
00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:34.430
And what a great episode, though.
不过，这集真的很棒。

126
00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:40.190
I mean, I know we didn't maybe give people what they were hoping to see with, like, the cliffhanger.
我是说，我知道我们可能没给观众提供他们期待看到的悬念解答。

127
00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:43.770
But we, I mean, comedy gold.
但我们，我是说，这简直是喜剧界的黄金。

128
00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:44.890
We gave them comedy gold.
我们给了他们喜剧界的黄金。

129
00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:47.130
Steve is so funny in this.
史蒂夫在这集里太搞笑了。

130
00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:47.650
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

131
00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:49.970
He is the worst patient.
他是个最糟糕的病人。

132
00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:51.170
The worSt.
最糟糕的。

133
00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:53.470
And he made me laugh so hard.
他把我逗得大笑不止。

134
00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:55.970
Fast fact number two.
速览事实之二。

135
00:04:56.590 --> 00:05:02.670
Guest star Marcus York played our building manager, Billy Merchant.
客串明星马库斯·约克饰演了我们的物业经理比利·默钱特。

136
00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:08.310
Now, I have to imagine this was a nod to creator of the British office, Stephen Merchant.
我猜这肯定是在向英版《办公室》的创作者斯蒂芬·默钱特致敬。

137
00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:10.830
I think that's where we grabbed that last name.
我想我们就是从那儿借用的这个姓氏。

138
00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:11.890
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

139
00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:12.930
I didn't even think about that.
我之前都没往那儿想。

140
00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:13.550
When we named Billy Merchant.
当我们给比利·默钱特起名的时候。

141
00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:13.710
Yeah.
是啊。

142
00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:14.930
I feel like that's true.
我觉得应该是这样。

143
00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:16.690
I got to talk to Marcus yesterday.
我昨天和马库斯聊了聊。

144
00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:19.030
Marcus, thanks so much for taking time out of your day.
马库斯，非常感谢你抽出时间。

145
00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:21.150
And here are a few things he shared with me.
以下是他和我分享的一些事情。

146
00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:21.610
Okay.
好的。

147
00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.870
So he auditioned for Allison, Mindy, and Greg.
他当时是为艾莉森、敏迪和格雷格试镜的。

148
00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.370
And he said it went really, really well.
他说试镜过程非常非常顺利。

149
00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:26.330
He was really excited.
他当时特别兴奋。

150
00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:29.250
You know that moment where you have a great meeting or a great audition?
你知道那种感觉吗，就是你进行了一次很棒的会议或试镜？

151
00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:29.450
Yeah.
是啊。

152
00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:30.410
He said that's how it felt.
他说当时就是那种感觉。

153
00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:33.330
He had been in LA as a working actor for a while.
他作为一名职业演员在洛杉矶待了一阵子了。

154
00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:37.250
And he said, this is one that I was like, ooh, ooh, I think I got it.
他说，这是他当时觉得“噢，噢，我觉得我能行”的那种角色。

155
00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:40.250
And he said that Greg jumped up and shook his hand.
他说格雷格当时跳起来和他握了手。

156
00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:40.790
Oh.
噢。

157
00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:41.970
And he was like, okay.
他说，好吧。

158
00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:43.630
And then he was running errands.
然后他当时正在办杂事。

159
00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:44.770
He was at Home Depot.
他在家得宝（Home Depot）。

160
00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:47.690
And he got the call that he got it.
然后他接到了电话，说他被录用了。

161
00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:50.170
And his agent was like, you got it.
他的经纪人说，你被录用了。

162
00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:50.870
And he was like, wait a second.
他说，等一下。

163
00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:51.610
I'm in Home Depot.
我在家得宝呢。

164
00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.670
I have to call you back.
我得回给你。

165
00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:54.870
So he said he'll always remember that.
所以他说他会永远记住那一刻。

166
00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:59.650
And then he said the night before he had to come in, he was nervous.
然后他说在进组的前一天晚上，他很紧张。

167
00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.210
And he got like, no sleep.
他几乎没怎么睡。

168
00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:02.610
He said, I got zero sleep.
他说，我一点都没睡着。

169
00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:07.090
He said, so then the next day I was freaking out because I hadn't gotten any sleep.
他说，所以第二天我快疯了，因为我根本没睡。

