Guys, next week we'll be back with The Secret, where we very much do propel the Jim Pam storyline forward.
伙计们，下周我们将回归《秘密》那一集，在那一集中，我们确实极大地推动了吉姆和帕姆的故事线。

1582
00:59:49.720 --> 00:59:54.260
Can Michael keep the secret that Jim told him on the booze cruise?
迈克尔能保守住吉姆在游船派对上告诉他的秘密吗？

1583
00:59:54.500 --> 00:59:55.120
The secret.
秘密。

1584
00:59:55.440 --> 00:59:56.200
The secret.
秘密。

1585
00:59:56.720 --> 00:59:57.340
Secret.
秘密。

1586
